    <body xml:id="m-5119b71f-3771-4eaf-826a-8bf1eccdee0d">
      <mdiv xml:id="m-c0ba535d-23cc-4cf7-bfa0-02e2af27b494" type="solesmes">
        <score xml:id="m-1b43b7b0-655a-49cb-a152-a5cd36bb3707">
          <section xml:id="m-108fe677-b60c-418c-aff8-f0892ba6d7e2">
            <pb xml:id="m-f705bbf5-5e98-4517-ae51-0a6fa0f3f037" n="0947" facs="#m-75eb9d7e-fceb-4a80-90f3-af708ef1636a" />
            <div xml:id="m-fec32eee-0e5e-430b-9353-aa7ec80c3dd6">
              <lg xml:id="m-0265681f-0341-4290-a303-5bf632b8cc0b">
                <l xml:id="m-a5b3673f-4f38-47f4-abb0-e7f8fb9885cf" facs="#m-45b1885e-c2bd-453c-967c-060a40c5c3d3" label="text-like">The blessing of water</l><l xml:id="m-12988b26-def8-4472-b5c3-50ece1ead912" facs="#m-7aef2d67-484f-4661-b8e4-af4f10fd2b22" label="ambiguous">77ex</l><l xml:id="m-8d84ac8a-13e5-4bec-89ba-69a54e0f5241" facs="#m-48c2bafb-9abc-4c56-a90a-414dd569d77e" label="text-like">With his hand, the celebrant di¬</l><l xml:id="m-9dddff5c-e02f-4c14-95b2-43e9a35751e2" facs="#m-da2c415a-6d27-4bdc-b2ef-f52c4d74e8bf" label="lyrics-like">cépit. Qui te in desérto amáram,</l><l xml:id="m-5138c187-f9d2-40aa-8443-5561f1e751ee" facs="#m-bb34ea10-8458-4004-b355-a6a81d4abf08" label="text-like">vides the water in the form of</l><l xml:id="m-93e32080-34b6-4707-9ad8-8684eb51ebb1" facs="#m-4a407220-f192-4d4f-bff9-3179138ecbff" label="lyrics-like">suavitãte indita, fecit esse potá¬</l><l xml:id="m-8e04ead5-e6a2-42dc-aeac-2ed5e1818ac0" facs="#m-9a1e6c13-ac80-4d52-a761-dbadb9dc785a" label="ambiguous">crosss he then wipes his hand ana</l><l xml:id="m-0e156f7e-c682-4279-9d02-b13aeb943470" facs="#m-a5ea2361-60e8-4a93-8a6c-28470777851c" label="lyrics-like">bilem, et sitiénti pópulo de petra</l><l xml:id="m-e00a7448-98a6-41ee-a189-79e40aafb611" facs="#m-e4f5a198-42c3-45eb-b534-822bac007412" label="ambiguous">continues:</l><l xml:id="m-78cf2b4d-b683-4ad3-930d-ee78e373553c" facs="#m-5ced1f5b-5800-45c2-8181-069204f70e0b" label="lyrics-like">prodúxit. Bene † dico te et per</l><l xml:id="m-31d4d024-1556-475a-b594-7f6ddc38d35c" facs="#m-c6723cc0-afd3-4a91-8b18-4619b25af2cb" label="lyrics-like">UI hanc aquam, regenerándis</l><l xml:id="m-a0069870-c430-48f6-9fc6-8206a3638e09" facs="#m-73123ce1-f662-4406-bdc7-f1503783accc" label="lyrics-like">Jesum Christum Filium ejus úni¬</l><l xml:id="m-28b4d7ee-9815-478b-a787-977874535908" facs="#m-2b84a9ce-ffe5-490e-8362-7a6c450433a2" label="lyrics-like">L hominibus praeparátam, ar¬</l><l xml:id="m-abbf13f2-ec6b-4bf9-bed1-00dbb53e55b9" facs="#m-afee48bf-9b61-4028-a79a-941c2defb74d" label="lyrics-like">cum, Dóminum nostrum: qui</l><l xml:id="m-c8499d58-7f2a-4848-99e2-8082543d4e16" facs="#m-0d4c4346-f7ee-4436-a1e5-e866fb8c54da" label="lyrics-like">cána sui núminis admixtióne fe¬</l><l xml:id="m-216bd075-454e-4205-b35d-216956b86194" facs="#m-60f74067-e434-47db-b482-eba71e327f88" label="lyrics-like">te in Cana Galilaéae signo admi¬</l><l xml:id="m-325b4790-5b1c-4c60-83cd-571ab6c0b3c9" facs="#m-65ddcf99-7a4b-48c4-9055-e3efa143bc43" label="lyrics-like">cúndet: ut, sanctificatióne concé¬</l><l xml:id="m-c2288f9e-13f1-4954-a960-3f4f35886416" facs="#m-eb9dc85d-601c-468b-9d76-a68f133e1888" label="lyrics-like">rábili, sua poténtia convértit in</l><l xml:id="m-fb7d2652-749f-4bf6-9aa9-59b168328959" facs="#m-db85585f-3543-42b3-874c-583f9fb2ae7e" label="lyrics-like">pta, ab immaculáto divini fontis</l><l xml:id="m-e624d8d9-b60e-4442-968f-aea5b88805cb" facs="#m-8d0801e5-93dc-41d5-bc64-fcc7d132cada" label="lyrics-like">vinum. Qui pédibus super te</l><l xml:id="m-f5063a6b-4d3d-4aa1-a6e2-8db5e02f20f0" facs="#m-ee682fc2-0802-4d53-bdc3-a9cef195b9f6" label="lyrics-like">ütero, in novam renáta creatú¬</l><l xml:id="m-71088bca-55f9-4939-a6ce-c782343a3f6c" facs="#m-7e7606cf-7f31-4ee9-8326-6e2727a54a5f" label="lyrics-like">ambulávit: et a Joánne in</l><l xml:id="m-4ee40030-d1e2-4355-980a-4edfae312d43" facs="#m-03465827-b5c4-4fd0-af2f-9f7b157cca64" label="lyrics-like">ram, progénies caeléstis emérgat:</l><l xml:id="m-d598307f-c2db-4338-8e79-6b17ba5c43ef" facs="#m-93844fb0-293b-4bc7-91f4-897db526f2ac" label="lyrics-like">Jordáne in te baptizátus est.</l><l xml:id="m-aa5c1194-55e4-40b3-b0f0-ceab08c2230a" facs="#m-6e626b56-e229-412b-bac4-1ee28d029820" label="lyrics-like">et quos aut sexus in córpore, aut</l><l xml:id="m-6ede7a78-ba96-4503-8cb6-808880d698ef" facs="#m-cf301312-354a-4efe-8c52-6148adc1eec7" label="lyrics-like">Qui te una cum sánguine de</l><l xml:id="m-b774dd6e-37b1-43f0-ac97-89c83813529c" facs="#m-f76eb0cc-5f90-44b5-a977-009f0baa0a96" label="lyrics-like">aetas discérnit in témpore, om¬</l><l xml:id="m-77f342fb-dffb-468c-b635-da52b3c00994" facs="#m-53876f2c-90d0-4bb0-826f-a143ebd1b0ba" label="lyrics-like">látere suo prodúxit : et discipulis</l><l xml:id="m-0dbffda5-292d-4890-af6f-1efd86d2c98d" facs="#m-0cfe5309-1bb1-45b4-a968-9ec3ae018bb9" label="lyrics-like">nes in unam páriat grátia mater</l><l xml:id="m-2b880f83-1461-470c-9ce7-d77a6699e5d0" facs="#m-988cc10b-4bff-4d73-a24c-30a9365142b7" label="lyrics-like">suis jussit, ut credéntes bapti¬</l><l xml:id="m-b9c43337-d4e1-4115-b694-5319ff4cc1d3" facs="#m-01974ac4-9b49-4e3b-8f49-f687e5dcbeb1" label="lyrics-like">infántiam. Procul ergo hinc,</l><l xml:id="m-e3d94e8f-b515-4288-8e2b-231b6b63972f" facs="#m-8ad1242d-b032-4432-90cc-abc46ba1db51" label="lyrics-like">zaréntur in te, dicens: «ite,</l><l xml:id="m-f16bb349-f03d-4f44-9433-55d166817fe6" facs="#m-2cd9de33-357f-4a88-8452-ad0f7635e07a" label="lyrics-like">jubénte te, Dómine, omnis spi¬</l><l xml:id="m-afa97e57-40b5-4000-9916-db327475ca32" facs="#m-728f855b-0b30-4991-a027-d315ccfa8e12" label="lyrics-like">docéte omnes gentes, baptizán¬</l><l xml:id="m-63b37ddf-b7d0-4cea-bd07-59868e4c91ae" facs="#m-a73d52b5-c891-4c1f-b5f5-c5eb3bf6b0af" label="lyrics-like">ritus immúndus abscédat: pro¬</l><l xml:id="m-53b07853-9ad4-4ca4-a328-3b40d758695a" facs="#m-37f31bd9-c84a-4d11-818f-44e2834a1ffa" label="lyrics-like">tes eos in nómine Patris, et</l><l xml:id="m-e810c940-703d-4ba7-9ab0-09f165b2683c" facs="#m-5fb5d5a4-ab29-40e1-b199-d73d5685f168" label="lyrics-like">cul tota nequitia diabólicae frau¬</l><l xml:id="m-0678e4d5-a232-40ab-898a-b73b1c4afea2" facs="#m-85a791cd-0a7b-4329-909b-79db2d1a4eef" label="lyrics-like">Flli, et Spíritus Sancti ».</l><l xml:id="m-2b223bb1-a08f-4f7c-95d3-73d01e53cbc1" facs="#m-21e99880-a1f3-4132-a0f6-11faa5cb259f" label="lyrics-like">dis absistat. Nihil hic loci hábeat</l><l xml:id="m-1e67ec85-3dd9-42bb-9832-26975ebcab0e" facs="#m-12374b1d-a678-426b-9602-cdfa32d10344" label="text-like">Then the celebrant, without chant,</l><l xml:id="m-71919978-dcda-40e6-9a9d-76ba1125b294" facs="#m-721fb8e3-275f-43da-988d-189ddaea190a" label="lyrics-like">contráriae virtútis admíxtio</l><l xml:id="m-64fbc22d-de74-47e8-a180-d14d3f550756" facs="#m-c8295df0-8828-4b78-98ab-86470e3c6ba4" label="ambiguous">says:</l><l xml:id="m-40b63f9a-ae6d-4a6c-a457-c5fc89d23116" facs="#m-84dfe5ad-3e47-4148-b26e-569a292d061e" label="lyrics-like">non insidiándo circúmvolet : non</l><l xml:id="m-c02b90fb-fbcf-48b4-a934-dc28ca9e9cef" facs="#m-27e58174-1407-4e4b-b5fe-99f754e3ab83" label="lyrics-like">EÆC nobis praecépta serván¬</l><l xml:id="m-0437437c-5e4b-417e-996a-4df49095d21e" facs="#m-15907149-125d-4ca4-86d9-dfdb4389b627" label="lyrics-like">laténdo subrépat : non inficiéndo</l><l xml:id="m-ac08b4e5-4b16-464a-bcac-8a7e203f60e2" facs="#m-d5905837-4523-4c6d-959b-7f9228033e3c" label="ambiguous">Et tibus, tu, Deus omnipotens,</l><l xml:id="m-21ee496b-0e8f-4c13-89e7-2b22cb462c77" facs="#m-433cf393-e7a1-4df8-891a-dfb7ceb695fe" label="lyrics-like">corrúmpat.</l><l xml:id="m-be0609c5-c9d3-4f2f-a5fa-6e75cca303bb" facs="#m-8e213e9d-e5ea-47ee-bacf-31486a585df8" label="lyrics-like">clemens adésto: tu benignus</l><l xml:id="m-2f884d53-311e-4bbd-ac88-51bbba23412b" facs="#m-2b7e5bb9-629c-4959-985f-c1e790798d0d" label="text-like">He touches the water with his hand:</l><l xml:id="m-7fbb71a9-6956-4ca7-aa2c-030b703716c8" facs="#m-3c1dd1fb-8e6c-4cdc-86f0-e320c78bf741" label="lyrics-like">aspíra.</l><l xml:id="m-dd4ecd81-2df2-45d2-b01f-177cb7680551" facs="#m-c126e39a-0d81-4791-831b-13e23b631d8a" label="ambiguous">IT haec sancta et innocens</l><l xml:id="m-3cc8ebb0-bfda-40be-a70f-fdfc21f2c426" facs="#m-cd42d0df-a43b-445e-a993-8d7144261ffb" label="text-like">He breathes thrice upon the water</l><l xml:id="m-af51361e-77f4-4468-8499-4826d62f8a29" facs="#m-0bddec94-8d91-44ac-a550-5bdc0ae2cd13" label="lyrics-like">O creatúra, libera ab omni im¬</l><l xml:id="m-9fecf2bf-35e1-4d95-8a69-2dc59d77f565" facs="#m-81f05afa-938c-4560-957f-813b265c80e0" label="text-like">in the form of a cross, saving:</l><l xml:id="m-5607ab20-f2e5-4f8b-af31-76b6a3d989da" facs="#m-97d60fdb-dc8f-4062-8941-192f319bb970" label="lyrics-like">pugnatóris incúrsu, et totius</l><l xml:id="m-c969e433-3007-4af5-903c-87df6fc3440d" facs="#m-07cedee0-6884-4892-9f2a-6d6f804e58a6" label="ambiguous">¡U has simplices aquas tuo</l><l xml:id="m-8dbb65ab-7a1c-4288-8a19-149034aea0f5" facs="#m-3ae91eef-4d2c-435b-a2dd-dfc5fbe521b8" label="lyrics-like">nequítiae purgáta discéssu. Sit</l><l xml:id="m-29f4ebc0-6937-4ae9-b2bc-4631e58530dd" facs="#m-989fb30b-7515-4bfd-b0a9-2c3e86688f1c" label="ambiguous">1 ore benedicito: ut praeter</l><l xml:id="m-7c4db6c7-30b0-4bb3-93b7-a55ae95be1bd" facs="#m-e6dad9d9-c591-4fac-897b-8ed201e3a101" label="lyrics-like">fons vivus, aqua regénerans,</l><l xml:id="m-17e15441-6611-420f-a246-e6a1d7eb9aa2" facs="#m-cbdc898b-71a3-4b2c-b9d0-3b71078cbc79" label="lyrics-like">naturálem emundatiónem, quam</l><l xml:id="m-497e6279-483a-407a-9e84-8c46f3281f9f" facs="#m-ae4edb09-156e-4d42-81ee-8280aa64dbb6" label="ambiguous">unda purificans : ut omnes hoc</l><l xml:id="m-e9b09c14-787c-4087-ae6b-1b3a3f8ffa65" facs="#m-43d4df52-7700-4aa9-96f0-429eb2cac9ca" label="lyrics-like">lavándis possunt adhibére cor¬</l><l xml:id="m-fc645c68-a771-450e-b535-9e12f95a3c96" facs="#m-a994da6e-dd19-4d07-af72-424eeb88294b" label="lyrics-like">lavácro salutífero diluéndi, ope¬</l><l xml:id="m-d10d76e2-dae3-4486-9107-535724043e84" facs="#m-113c6bf5-8468-401a-ace6-8cd52e88465a" label="lyrics-like">póribus, sint étiam purificándis</l><l xml:id="m-1d1a9dbf-54b0-43b3-a5c7-70e7f2dd0e6a" facs="#m-46fa85b9-46ff-443f-9134-eae27bca4848" label="lyrics-like">ránte in eis Spíritu Sancto, per¬</l><l xml:id="m-71599f3e-edb3-4b95-87cc-ebaab00e62d7" facs="#m-a58c7ec8-cf9b-42bd-bc5b-f8460645e02b" label="lyrics-like">méntibus efficáces.</l><l xml:id="m-b98a9573-10ac-497b-afe0-721ced51c4e4" facs="#m-128588ab-8048-4171-b8b9-84fc39c4ef1f" label="lyrics-like">féctae purgatiónis indulgéntiam</l><l xml:id="m-65a2efee-b947-494b-95c4-fe25451c73b2" facs="#m-e3c0971e-7440-48a9-af10-3202245847e4" label="text-like">He sinks the Paschal Candle into</l><l xml:id="m-7a764aa0-1500-42df-a44e-c763ce94899d" facs="#m-721a9131-532c-4987-a5a5-3a18c4137eca" label="lyrics-like">consequántur.</l><l xml:id="m-bcb1a122-a41d-4a41-b441-923e43b40575" facs="#m-ad2d69c7-effc-4a45-b32c-41d64e0bd3bc" label="text-like">the water three times, singing each</l><l xml:id="m-02472964-11f1-43c2-acd4-f05f92632268" facs="#m-8c0222e4-a3f0-44b9-92b1-067cd2e3ba69" label="text-like">He makes the sien of the cross</l><l xml:id="m-aa7e257d-8a8b-41d7-ade5-dc123e8a3c27" facs="#m-50f7286d-7b36-4fe5-9110-6a1a4d99d49d" label="text-like">time, in the tone of the Preface:</l><l xml:id="m-6a3108ec-0078-439c-9867-32e1b69f41bc" facs="#m-34197018-1bcd-4a81-b06f-c50308479692" label="text-like">three times over the vater sayins:</l><l xml:id="m-f9e1082e-7dbc-49a6-8cf2-4a94cf0e9347" facs="#m-fe983031-ac51-485f-8b61-7ff93bb9eee9" label="lyrics-like">LEscéndat in hanc plenitú¬</l><l xml:id="m-2ff54d2e-e2fb-4391-85a0-afa31abc6412" facs="#m-0eaf61a7-88c8-45d2-b1d0-47f6dc2420e2" label="lyrics-like">¡Nde benedico te, creatúra</l><l xml:id="m-ac0b539b-8ee7-4af2-be36-90c11452ea2c" facs="#m-71dfe76c-1f8f-4b87-a4e2-653acebad961" label="ambiguous">U dinem fontis virtus Spiritus</l><l xml:id="m-4931cfd1-2525-4ed6-a7b5-c26058a57e94" facs="#m-b45335f6-f5f1-4df0-adcc-77e5c06cbe8a" label="ambiguous">U aquae, per Deum ★ vivum,</l><l xml:id="m-99b3d627-e300-4151-821e-edb3d64a5f46" facs="#m-fdc54019-629b-4881-ae17-ca37d1ed8116" label="ambiguous">Sancti.</l><l xml:id="m-5ff92dab-96d9-45a5-bc43-c66726a91283" facs="#m-bc063e9c-89ca-4d51-ad4b-e5023d8d50bd" label="ambiguous">per Deum — verum, per Deum</l><l xml:id="m-d145384a-c61a-4010-b24e-d4dac07c027e" facs="#m-dda555cc-6471-4fbe-840c-7a36f3d25135" label="text-like">Before removing the Candle he</l><l xml:id="m-fc7bd7c8-a373-4903-bad3-1a75ae061b07" facs="#m-e623030a-9ea6-4089-9fdf-3f82e082e2b3" label="ambiguous"> sanctum : per Deum, qui te,</l><l xml:id="m-dc95ca73-5e61-41ce-8e5f-04f5b8c74e74" facs="#m-17e77f25-e8de-4d92-9860-86877aed12c3" label="text-like">breaihes three times upon the water:</l><l xml:id="m-f009b08b-61b9-4e81-a0a7-93feeb71ddf2" facs="#m-a09df226-04b0-41d9-8822-7e1ebdc84e5f" label="lyrics-like">in principio, verbo separávit ab</l><l xml:id="m-5af94931-c738-4016-be10-7efd44b70bc7" facs="#m-780b4a1b-bd79-41db-b08f-5aab7163c6b9" label="lyrics-like">potámque hujus aquae sub¬</l><l xml:id="m-3b3bfabb-760f-4c91-a44c-948b1ea63252" facs="#m-78a7511a-a3c5-4f12-987a-9c9037b49323" label="lyrics-like">árida: cujus Spiritus super te</l><l xml:id="m-22da0a91-2e5f-442d-b289-7cf8f8d23ac4" facs="#m-3d0486a9-bdde-4475-bb5d-bab9cf1c9839" label="lyrics-like">ferebátur.</l><l xml:id="m-ab6d6da5-2dc3-4dcd-a526-84a6bb99d8c4" facs="#m-ed224a6e-a156-47d8-a8de-3b749a809274" label="lyrics-like">Istántiam, regenerándi fe¬</l><l xml:id="m-1166c9eb-5fa6-4b8f-8391-d00505e776bb" facs="#m-0a2a9f6b-1ee5-4560-872c-4fc5de289e57" label="lyrics-like">cúndet efféctu.</l><l xml:id="m-61547f7e-9ff2-4d5d-82ed-86168e59a82a" facs="#m-65f38604-7a64-41f6-95be-b02287038f52" label="text-like">Here he divides the water uith his</l><l xml:id="m-e48e4764-c572-436c-b1b9-fd894b1b7ace" facs="#m-0e22342c-096e-4dde-9d71-a648f02fe92f" label="text-like">He takes the Candle out of the</l><l xml:id="m-9d866278-8285-419d-b02b-71bf5588ea6a" facs="#m-16992df2-3fc4-4bbd-8f4c-f4d5ad62ff2e" label="text-like">hand and throus some of it towards</l><l xml:id="m-b49e8c76-8adb-4932-98c2-ed4b55082b20" facs="#m-f7299e2a-2282-47d9-91c3-9a6d74822ff1" label="text-like">the four quarters of the world, saving:</l><l xml:id="m-30cf066e-d1c4-49a9-8a76-fa3ef60b0e5c" facs="#m-bdcfb3aa-3791-4c1b-b333-086e27e1a686" label="text-like">water and says:</l><l xml:id="m-f49a10e3-ebc7-4cc8-a01b-060988ecddfd" facs="#m-bb5f9df8-9d4b-4a6b-a317-edf1620376f8" label="lyrics-like">Fic ómnium peccatórum má¬</l><l xml:id="m-519f5468-2922-4110-8325-2c8972cb5fdb" facs="#m-a3d62470-0738-46e9-8d84-a8377526b8b1" label="lyrics-like">AUl te de paradísi fonte maná¬</l><l xml:id="m-0c23dfc6-463a-4ce1-86c9-6c3c72b593ab" facs="#m-3c0516f6-ec99-4abf-8b70-13f6b9b17d15" label="lyrics-like">U re fecit, et in quátuor flumí¬</l><l xml:id="m-b75372ca-dc18-414b-aa47-7f9e7613a9f8" facs="#m-a096b359-bb3a-4d88-855b-767cc8178a43" label="lyrics-like">Et culae deleántur : hic natúra</l><l xml:id="m-e8c21d6e-024a-4495-8b63-f9f92e677d9b" facs="#m-cdae6315-079d-4254-9849-1da65b331321" label="lyrics-like">nibus totam terram rigáre prae-lad imáginem tuam cóndita, et</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>